WEBVTT

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.080
<i>Our parents are no longer here.</i>

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.830
<i>Because of that, Asu and I have to do our best on our own.</i>

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:20.700
<i>Sometimes it’s difficult, but the two of us still pull through.</i>

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.120
<i>So far, we’ve managed to get by this way.</i>

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.830
This month’s bills are going to put us in a bit of a pinch, huh?

00:00:26.830 --> 00:00:28.170
Yes, it’ll be a pinch.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:34.530
<i>Spring, which will bring this sakura tree into bloom, is still far away,</i>

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:36.990
<i>and a harsh winter is right around the corner.</i>

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:41.350
<i>We don’t have anyone to protect us from the cold.</i>

00:00:42.090 --> 00:00:44.780
<i>There isn’t anyone who understands this type of coldness.</i>

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:46.740
<i>That’s what I think.</i>

00:00:47.470 --> 00:00:48.730
That said…

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:49.890
Yes.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:50.870
That said…

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:55.240
We won’t lose!

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.580
Onee-chan, the landlord is looking at the sakura tree.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:08.400
Ah, you’re right.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:11.480
Let’s try asking him for an extension, one more time.{HERP DERP WE SO POOR}

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:14.040
Is it even worth trying?

00:01:14.420 --> 00:01:16.610
We’ve already asked him so many times.

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.440
He’ll probably just tell us no again.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.390
We’ll worry about that when it happens.{When that happens we’ll think of something.}{That’ll happen when it happens}

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:38.030
Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:41.700
Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.

00:01:42.350 --> 00:01:46.000
Thus, we were abandoned.

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:50.860
This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.890
This is our home.

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.630
But, when spring comes…

