00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:40.630
Mr. Landlord!

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:02.500
Eriko!

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:03.550
Mami!

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:11.820
Ah, um… What do you want?

00:04:12.330 --> 00:04:13.730
Um, well…

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:20.570
Um, can we please postpone this month’s rent payment until I get my paycheck?{Um, for this month’s rent, can you wait a couple days until I get my pay from work?}

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.360
Oh, sure. I don’t mind.

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.650
We’re saved.

00:04:33.650 --> 00:04:36.940
But, don’t you think he was acting kind of strange?

00:04:36.940 --> 00:04:40.980
Yeah. I wonder who Eriko-san and Mami-san are.

00:04:42.590 --> 00:04:45.510
What was the landlord looking at?

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:47.770
Just what did he see?

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.290
I’m home!

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.790
Asu, I got my paycheck!

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.130
Welcome home, Onee-chan.

00:05:20.130 --> 00:05:20.980
Here.

00:05:23.570 --> 00:05:25.470
Thank you for all your work.

00:05:25.470 --> 00:05:28.990
I also got paid for my tutoring job,{This month I’ve also received pay from my tutoring job.}

00:05:28.990 --> 00:05:31.220
so we should have a little left over this month.

00:05:31.220 --> 00:05:32.680
That’s great, Onee-chan!

00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:38.330
First of all, since the landlord was nice enough to wait this long, we should take care of last month’s rent.{First we have to pay off the rent from last month to Owner-san.}

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:42.860
Also, tomorrow I have the day off. Why don’t we go somewhere together?{And then, tomorrow I have a day off. Let’s go out somewhere.}

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:45.820
Okay.

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:48.000
Where should we go?

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.450
Anywhere is fine.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.190
We can keep thinking about it until tomorrow.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:55.560
Sure.{Ok.}

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:32.700
Asu, have you thought of somewhere you really want to go?

00:06:33.430 --> 00:06:36.160
Nope. Have you?

00:06:36.870 --> 00:06:37.930
Not yet.

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:40.780
I’m still thinking. {about it}

00:06:49.760 --> 00:06:52.370
It seems like staying at home is the best after all.{Ah, home is where the heart is.}{lolno}{Hmmm… looks like home is still the best place.}

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:53.970
Isn’t it?

00:06:57.790 --> 00:06:58.790
What is it?

00:06:58.790 --> 00:06:59.830
Over there.

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:00.970
Where?

00:07:00.970 --> 00:07:02.370
Over there, over there.

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:11.450
Onee-chan, that’s…

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:14.200
Yeah, it’s blooming!

00:07:22.170 --> 00:07:25.000
It’s already evening, Onee-chan.{It’s getting dark, Onee-chan.}

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:26.630
So it is.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:31.260
But at least today was a good chance to just relax. It was nice, wasn’t it?{But, today wasn’t too bad.}

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.470
Yeah, it was.{Right!}

00:07:34.840 --> 00:07:38.310
Hey, Onee-chan, let’s go to the bath early tonight.{let’s go to Hawaii early tonight!}

00:07:38.810 --> 00:07:41.740
Sure! You want to go now?{should we go early today?}

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:50.860
We’ll be able to take our time and relax.{Well then, I’m going to soak myself well today}

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:53.070
Sure! Let’s go.

00:08:07.920 --> 00:08:10.170
Bath House Hawaii

00:08:11.480 --> 00:08:12.860
Welco—

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:17.390
Hmm? What’s wrong? Kyou-chan, Asu-chan!

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.350
The two of you don’t look so well.

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:28.110
What happened, Kyou-chan?

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:34.570
Oba-san, we’ve been told we have to leave our apartment! {being evicted from our apartment!}

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:37.260
What do you mean?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:43.060
Mr. Landlord, good evening.

00:08:43.060 --> 00:08:45.250
We’re heading over to the bathhouse right now.

00:08:45.530 --> 00:08:46.630
I see.

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:51.710
That aside, you two—can you move out of the apartment?

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.680
I said, move out of the apartment.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:09:00.470
Wh-Why?

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:05.480
We just paid last month’s rent yesterday!{make it more of a joke about "just paid this month’s rent"}

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:08.150
It’s urgent, so hurry up and leave.{There’s no more time. I would like for you two to leave as soon as possible.}

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:09.750
No way…

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:16.110
If you make us leave, we won’t have anywhere to live!{We don’t have anywhere else to go other than this apartment!}

00:09:16.440 --> 00:09:20.580
If you won’t cooperate with me, I’ll have to force you to leave. {If I assert my landowner’s power, then you two will have to leave quickly.}

