I came across some news by way of a rumor.

00:10:31.040 --> 00:10:35.160
It seems like they’re going to build a luxury mansion complex here.{"luxury mansion complex" is a very sketchy phrase but I left it in because it made me laugh}{s/very sketchy/really retarded/}{I hope "luxury mansion complex" makes you giggle as much as it makes me giggle.}

