Onee-chan, do you think this sakura tree will be cut down, too?

00:10:57.070 --> 00:10:59.220
If they’re building a mansion, it probably will.

00:10:59.600 --> 00:11:03.560
Now that I think about it, the landlord was gazing at this tree.

00:11:04.660 --> 00:11:08.020
He’ll probably miss his precious sakura tree, don’t you think?

