00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:42.530
I don’t want to leave.

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:45.660
I want to watch the flowers bloom there next year!{I want to see the sakura blossom next year.}

00:12:48.220 --> 00:12:51.780
<i>It’s strange to hear Asu say something that sounds selfish.</i>

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:55.140
<i>But I feel the same way.</i>

00:12:55.140 --> 00:12:57.740
<i>I suppose we’re both being selfish.</i>

00:12:58.600 --> 00:13:00.430
<i>I’m not sure why,</i>

00:13:00.430 --> 00:13:06.120
<i>but looking at all the newer, bigger apartments and imagining how wonderful living in them would be,</i>

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:08.550
<i>for some reason, I can’t enjoy it.</i>

00:13:09.090 --> 00:13:15.820
<i>All I can think about was how nice it would be if we could keep living at our old apartment.{I can only think, "Why must they tear down that apartment…"}</i>

